      "content": "I am sorry you are feeling so discouraged today; please know that self-identity can feel unstable during life changes but does not actually \"decay\" in a permanent way. It is a sign of self-awareness that you can step back and intentionally choose to build the \"you\" you want to be now, rather than trying to recreate a past self. You have the power to write with the current version of yourself, which feels more authentic and alive than any imitation.",
